{"title":"Dune Skirmisher","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 37 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 8 times (2.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>689</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>806</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>673</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>630</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><t